```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Meu Vídeo</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #0f172a;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
        }

        header {
            background: #1d4ed8;
            padding: 25px;
        }

        header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 30px;
        }

        main {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .video {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            padding-bottom: 56.25%;
            height: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-radius: 15px;
            background: black;
        }

        .video iframe {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            border: 0;
        }

        .botao {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 25px;
            padding: 14px 25px;
            background: #dc2626;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .botao:hover {
            background: #b91c1c;
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding: 20px;
            background: #020617;
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>🎥 Meu Vídeo</h1>
    </header>

    <main>

        <h2>Assista ao vídeo</h2>

        <div class="video">
            <iframe
                src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/LkBjOeoHBhA"
                title="Vídeo do YouTube"
                allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                allowfullscreen>
            </iframe>
        </div>

        <a
            class="botao"
            href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LkBjOeoHBhA"
            target="_blank">
            ▶ Abrir no YouTube
        </a>

    </main>

    <footer>
        Meu site - Vídeo do YouTube
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
```
